Cell["\<\
For the 6D_1 GRW solution (e4, e5) = (1, 0) this is the Schwarzschild value \
48m\.b2/r\:2076, finite at r = 2m: \
\>", "CodeText",ExpressionUUID->"0de56554-cf0c-4cd0-8465-248b6642ef5f"],

